sequenceDiagram
    participant F1 as Connection Fiber A
    participant S as FiberSocket
    participant P as Proactor loop
    participant K as Kernel
    participant F2 as Connection Fiber B

    F1->>S: WriteSome(iovec)
    S->>K: submit send / try sendmsg
    alt 不能立即完成
      S->>P: Suspend 当前 Fiber
      P->>F2: 运行其他 ready Fiber
      K-->>P: CQE 或 EPOLLOUT
      P->>F1: 放回 ready queue
      F1->>S: 从等待点继续
    else 立即完成
      S-->>F1: bytes written
    end
